{{end}}{{end}}{{if .Gaps}}
Nobody established these, so do not invent a number, a name or a case study for them. This list is for you alone — it must never appear on screen, and a caption ABOUT what is missing is the worst possible use of it:
{{range .Gaps}}- {{.}}
{{end}}{{end}}
Before you answer, check five things. Every spine.emphasis appears word for word inside its own beat's heading. Every figure is from the vocabulary. No shot has more or fewer objects than it takes. Every `chapter` beat has an ordinal and no other beat has one. And no heading or caption mentions the brief, the script, the facts, or anything you were asked to do — they are lines for a viewer who has seen none of that.
{{- end}}
